usage: graspgen_worker.py [-h] --config CONFIG --grasp-repo GRASP_REPO
                          [--serve] [--ready READY] [--request REQUEST]

GraspGen worker, isolated from LIBERO's MuJoCo / robosuite environment. All
point clouds and returned poses use the *same world coordinate frame* and
meters. The worker subtracts and restores the observed point-cloud mean
exactly once. It does not require an object pose or a bundled object manifest.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --grasp-repo GRASP_REPO
  --serve
  --ready READY
  --request REQUEST     Single-request JSON file for diagnostics
